**Scope (from scope.yml):** `spare.com`, `sparelabs.com`, `platform.sparelabs.com`, `api.sparelabs.com`, `routing.sparelabs.com`, `forms.sparelabs.com` — all **In**. All other subdomains and third-party services are **Out of Scope**.

