- [NEW] **Engage GET schema disclosure re-confirmed live** this session: `caseType` 200/547B and `form` 200/1861B for GRT UUID `1966c7f8-...` (`caseTypeId=039fa858-ae9c-4c0c-a0a8-078f382066be`, PII fields incl. required `expiry` date + `mobilityPlusIdNumber`, field/form UUIDs). CORS reflect confirmed.
