## Objective
- Continue the 8-step bug-hunter analysis cycle for the Spare program (phase POC, target api) as analyst model `bigpickle`.
- Execute the planned passive probe to expand the unauth WorkOS SSO-config tenant roster (`POST /v1/identity/workos/auth`) and emit the full STEP 1–7 structured output.

## Important Details
- 8-step protocol: DELTA → PRIORITIZE → HYPOTHESES (≤3, max 1/asset, strict schema, one field per line, never inline confidence/class in title) → SELF-CRITIQUE (`[PARKED]`/`[FINAL]`) → NEXT (exactly one: PROBE/SCAN/RAG/HUMAN) → LEARN (`[LEARN] REJECTED/ACCEPTED <class> @ <asset>: <reason>`) → RISK (per-host 0–100).
- Scope IN: spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com. ALL OTHER subdomains OOS (includes metabase.*, api.us.*, admin-*.vercel.app, ngrok hosts).
- Passive-first: ≤1 rps, GET/HEAD only, no account creation, no data modification; secrets sha256 only; scanners need manual validation.
- Established 86h+ stable findings (updated 2026-08-15): `api.sparelabs.com/v1/global/regions` scheme-only bypass (`Bearer x`→200+725B, sha256 `fb9800acb09b65ec92591f4536e3ecfd08b8c3dba0d2ef9af3ed97047795c3fe`; longcat "PATCHED" claim = false positive, only tested no-auth); `/v1/global/organizations` zero-header read-only GET bypass (200+11B, writes 401); universal CORS credential reflection across all `/v1`; `/v1/public/organizations/key/{key}` org-key 3-way oracle with live set CLOSED at {spare,grt,dallas,winnipeg,hsr}; `/v1/public/organizations/{id}` 3-way UUID oracle (plural, stable) vs singular flapping 3-way↔2-way (downgraded to validation-leak-only); `/v1/identity/workos/auth` SSO-config oracle with 7 tenants (spare.com, dart.org, translink.ca, mbta.com, saskatoon.ca, kingcounty.gov→`conn_01JKRZ46KNAQRZN3J3PYTJKWAQ`, octa.net); `/v1/public/engage/cases` + `caseForms` POST auth gate ABSENT (no 401, handler reach via 404/403/400).
- Class/hypotheses that are dead/rejected: controller-wide auth omission (route-specific to {organizations, regions} via 22-sibling sweep), write-escalation on bypass routes (GET read-only only), `engage` GET schema disclosure (flapping/unreliable), forms JS bundle infra leak (patched in `main.8a2a39cb.js`, zero refs), `routing.sparelabs.com` (envoy 404 since 2026-08-07), GitHub repo scan pipeline (misconfigured to gladiaio org, 0 files).

