- STABLE core findings (~86-87h unpatched at last cycle):
  - `/v1/global/regions` scheme-only auth bypass: `Authorization: Bearer x` (garbage token) → 200 + 725B region registry (7 regions, 6 OOS api/routing hosts); body sha256 `fb9800acb09b65ec92591f4536e3ecfd08b8c3dba0d2ef9af3ed97047795c3fe` byte-stable; no-Auth→400, wrong scheme→400, POST→401 (read-only); fleet parity across prod/us/us2/us3/jp/eu/uat. longcat "PATCHED" triage (2026-08-11) is FALSE POSITIVE — only tested no-auth path.
