  - `/v1/public/organizations/{id}` (plural): 3-way UUID enumeration oracle (malformed→400 ValidationError 263B, nil→404 NotFoundError 131B+correlationId, valid→200 HUMAN_ONLY). Singular `/v1/public/organization` FLAPPING 3-way↔2-way across envoy replicas — downgraded to validation-leak-only.
  - `/v1/public/organizations/key/{key}`: 3-way org-key oracle, live set DEFINITIVELY CLOSED at {spare, grt, dallas, winnipeg, hsr} (5 orgs; spare UUID d736519f-f384-4771-a2d2-4f95e884d790, grt UUID 1966c7f8-3e36-4320-b0d7-de0f7d8d4355); 22+ candidates all 404; prod-only data (uat/us2/jp→404).
