- [NEW] Full public API surface recovered via bundle reverse-engineering (no target traffic needed): `main.8a2a39cb.js` (7.16MB) sha256 **34f336cdc96ff2021d4cf566c4250881949e09f77f138282b091b233db6222d7** — byte-identical to KB record → **settles PATCHED/REINSTATED conflict as "bundle unchanged, leak stands"**. Public client methods recovered: `organizations/{id}`, `organizations/key/{key}`, `organization`, `terms`, **`mobileApps/{id}` (NEW route)**, `engage/caseType`, `engage/form`, `engage/caseForms`.
- [NEW] `/v1/public/engage/caseType` GET now reaches a handler deterministically on current envoy replica: unknown caseTypeKey → `404 124B {"name":"NotFoundError","message":"Other was not found"}` → **caseTypeKey-existence oracle** (KB previously recorded only flapping 400s for GET engage routes).
- [NEW] `/v1/public/mobileApps/{id}` GET: UUID/nil/malformed → `404 128B {"name":"NotFoundError","message":"MobileApp was not found"}` → mobileApp-ID existence oracle, path param unvalidated.
- [NEW] 429 burst limit observed on api.sparelabs.com at ~20 req/30s (sleep 1.2 insufficient).
- [NEW] From bundle: caseForms POST body = `{caseId, formId, metadata{field:v}}`; `postSubmissionToken({caseId, formId})` endpoint exists; portal convention `formKey === caseTypeKey` (`/forms/:orgId/:caseTypeKey` → params `organizationId+caseTypeKey+formKey`); caseTypes carry `.key` + `.defaultFormKey`; rider UI lists caseTypes via gated `caseTypes.list({status:Active, riderInterfaceVisibility:true})`.
- [CHANGED] form oracle deterministic this cycle on current replica: `404 123B "Form was not found"` for unknown formKey (OpenAPI-validating replica, no 400 flapping observed).
- [CHANGED] org-key body sizes drifted again: winnipeg 352B (was 288B), hsr 321B (was 318B).
- [REFINED] 35 formKey candidates (5×5 orgs + 10 extra) and 13 caseTypeKey candidates (grt/spare/winnipeg) **all 404** → key spaces are tenant-configured slugs, not guessable.
- [CONFIRMED] winnipeg UUID `6c84b370-5cc2-42c6-8cdd-146c99648535`, hsr UUID `83303a6b-fb96-4ff3-8f58-d6069a043fbb` extracted from key oracle.

