## Objective
- Continue passive-first bug bounty POC against in-scope Spare surface (api.sparelabs.com focus), proving/expanding the confirmed unauthenticated API findings (auth-bypass family, enumeration oracles, Engage write chain) and resolving the top WorkOS SSO-tenancy hypothesis, without data modification or account creation.

## Important Details
- In scope: spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com. ALL other subdomains OOS (incl. api.us.sparelabs.com, metabase.sparelabs.com, sparelabs.ca, admin-*.vercel.app).
- Passive-first only: GET/HEAD, ≤1 rps, no account creation, no data modification, no POST writes to non-public surfaces; valid-object "200" branches require HUMAN_ONLY authorized UUIDs; ~20 req/window rate budget respected.
- Core API findings confirmed 86h+ STABLE, fleet-wide 7-host parity (prod/us/us2/us3/jp/eu/uat): `/v1/global/organizations` GET zero-header bypass (200+11B `{"data":[]}`+ACAO+ACAC, read-only; writes→401); `/v1/global/regions` scheme-only bypass (Bearer x → 200+725B, sha256 fb9800acb09b65ec92591f4536e3ecfd08b8c3dba0d2ef9af3ed97047795c3fe; no-auth→400; POST→401); universal CORS credential reflection (non-path-conditional via 14/22-sibling sweep).
- Enumeration oracles live: `/v1/public/organizations/{id}` 3-way UUID oracle (stable, superior); `/v1/public/organizations/key/{key}` org-key oracle (live set CLOSED at {spare,grt,dallas,winnipeg,hsr}, 22 candidates 404, prod-only); `/v1/identity/workos/auth` SSO domain discriminator (7 tenants, connection_id byte-stable, fleet-parity). Singular `/v1/public/organization` oracle FLAPPING 3-way↔2-way, downgraded to validation-leak-only.
- Engage write chain: `/v1/public/engage/{cases,caseForms}` POST auth gate structurally ABSENT (empty→400 ValidationError no-401, nil-UUID→404 handler-reach, spare UUID→403 feature-flag gate); `/v1/public/engage/{caseType,form}` GET flapping between OpenAPI-validation 400 and router-level 400 — schema-disclosure UNCONFIRMED.
- Rejected/dead: forms.sparelabs.com JS bundle main.8a2a39cb.js PATCHED (zero infra refs; prior "REACTIVATED @ sha256 34f336cd" claim was FALSE POSITIVE, later re-verified PATCHED); routing.sparelabs.com envoy 404 no surface; write-escalation on global/* (writes gated); controller-wide omission (scoped to exactly {organizations, regions}); GitHub reposcan pipeline misconfigured (gladiaio org, 0 files).
- longcat "PATCHED" triage for /v1/global/regions is a known false positive — longcat only probed no-auth (400), never the Bearer-x vector.

