## Objective
- Continue the passive-first bug bounty engagement on the Spare program (POC phase, target `api.sparelabs.com`) and execute the 8-step analyst cycle per the session prompt: DELTA → PRIORITIZE → HYPOTHESES (max 3, strict one-field-per-line schema) → SELF-CRITIQUE → NEXT ACTION → LEARNING → RISK SCORE.
