## Important Details
- Scope (IN): spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com. All other subdomains of sparelabs.com / spare.com and third-party hosts are OUT of scope (metabase.sparelabs.com, admin-*.vercel.app, api-staking, ngrok tunnels, api.us.sparelabs.com all OOS/dead).
- Passive-first only: GET/HEAD, ≤1 rps, no account creation, no data modification; secrets hashed with sha256, never raw.
- Core stable findings (86h+ unpatched, fleet-wide across prod/us/us2/us3/jp/eu/uat):
  - `GET /v1/global/organizations`: zero-header read-only bypass → 200 + 11B `{"data":[]}` + ACAO:reflected + ACAC:true; POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE → 401 InvalidTokenError (auth asymmetry; read-only).
  - `GET /v1/global/regions`: scheme-only bypass — `Authorization: Bearer x` (even empty `Bearer` or lowercase `bearer x`) → 200 + 725B region registry (7 regions incl. 6 OOS api/routing subdomains), body sha256 `fb9800acb09b65ec92591f4536e3ecfd08b8c3dba0d2ef9af3ed97047795c3fe` byte-stable; no-header → 400; POST → 401. NOT patched despite longcat "PATCHED" false positive (longcat only tested the no-auth path).
  - `/v1/**`: universal CORS credential reflection (ACAO `<reflected>` + ACAC:true + GET,HEAD,PUT,PATCH,POST,DELETE + ACAH:Authorization,Content-Type), uniform on OPTIONS 204 + GET 200/401/404; non-path-conditional via 14/22-sibling sweep.
  - `/v1/public/organizations/{id}`: 3-way UUID oracle (malformed→400 ValidationError, nil→404 NotFoundError 131B, valid→200), superior to flapping singular.
  - `/v1/public/organizations/key/{key}`: 3-way org-key oracle, live set CLOSED at {spare, grt, dallas, winnipeg, hsr}; prod-only data; 22 new candidates 404. Known UUIDs: spare `d736519f-f384-4771-a2d2-4f95e884d790`, grt `1966c7f8-3e36-4320-b0d7-de0f7d8d4355`, dallas `e5f587ba-50e7-4b0c-a2e6-e01f061d048d`, winnipeg `6c84b370-5cc2-42c6-8cdd-146c99648535`.
  - `/v1/public/terms`: unauth data disclosure (`?mobileAppId=nil` → 200 + 137B terms URLs → sparelabs.com apex); per-tenant chain (spare→107B junk `"asdfd"`, winnipeg→197B real URL, grt/hsr/dallas→137B generic).
  - `/v1/identity/workos/auth`: unauth SSO-config oracle — POST domain discriminates 200 (configured) vs 404; discloses WorkOS client_id + connection_id + Entra tenant IDs; roster CLOSED at 8 tenants (spare.com, dart.org, translink.ca, mbta.com, saskatoon.ca, kingcounty.gov `conn_01JKRZ46KNAQRZN3J3PYTJKWAQ`, winnipeg.ca `conn_01HP76PPV8CMRJH6RYRTWEPSGS`, +1); exact-match string keying; dictionary exhausted.
  - `POST /v1/public/engage/{cases,caseForms}`: auth gate STRUCTURALLY ABSENT — empty POST→400 ValidationError (no 401), nil-UUID→404 handler-reach, spare UUID→403 ForbiddenError (feature-flag gate, not auth); CORS reflected. Write-IDOR POC currently blocked: no known org has the external-case-creation flag ON, and caseForms needs a real formId.
  - `platform.sparelabs.com/login`: CSP infra leak — admin-eam-app.vercel.app + admin-fixed-route-app.vercel.app (prod+staging, loadable 200) + Metabase (prod+staging 200) + 9 cloud services (Cognito/Stripe/DO-Spaces/S3/Sentry/Intercom/Mapbox/Pusher/Twilio/LiveKit).
- `forms.sparelabs.com` JS bundle `main.8a2a39cb.js` CONFIRMED PATCHED — zero sparelabs/atlassian/ngrok/metabase/vercel refs; 3 Google Maps keys all referrer-restricted. (Interim "REACTIVATED" claim at sha256 `34f336cd…` was later rejected as false positive.)
- `routing.sparelabs.com` STABLE dead (envoy 404 on all paths since 2026-08-07, now responsive); sparelabs.com 301→spare.com; GitHub repo scan broken (gladiaio org misconfig, 0 files — do not trust until clone target fixed).
- Risk scores (last): api 99 | platform 75 | routing 8 | forms 5 | web 5.

