## Objective
- Continue passive-first (GET/HEAD, ≤1 rps, no account creation) POC-phase testing of the Spare program, target `api.sparelabs.com`.
- Stabilize/quantify the top confirmed findings for the report: `/v1/global/regions` scheme-only Bearer auth bypass, `/v1/global/organizations` zero-header fail-open, WorkOS SSO enumeration oracle, Engage POST auth-gate absence.

## Important Details
- In scope: spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com. Everything else (metabase.sparelabs.com, staging/regional hosts, admin-*.vercel.app, ngrok) is OUT of scope.
- Multi-version envoy LB behind api.sparelabs.com causes replica flapping: fast replica 1–4ms, slow replica 591–1500ms; route behaviors can flip between probes (e.g. singular `/v1/public/organization` flaps 404↔400 on nil-UUID).
- `/v1/global/regions` body: 725B, 7 regions (CA/US/US2/US3/JP/EU/UAT) each with `apiUrl`+`routingHost`; sha256 `fb9800acb09b65ec92591f4536e3ecfd08b8c3dba0d2ef9af3ed97047795c3fe`, byte-stable 86h+ across 7 fleet hosts.
- longcat triage "PATCHED" (2026-08-11) on `/v1/global/regions` is a FALSE POSITIVE — longcat only tested no-auth (400), never tested `Bearer x`; bypass remains live.
- Auth asymmetry pattern: GET fails open (zero-header or scheme-only), write verbs POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE return 401 `InvalidTokenError` (read-only bypass, no write escalation).
- Bypass family scoped exactly to `/v1/global/{organizations, regions}` — 22 sibling routes + 8 undocumented controllers all return 401.
- Secrets never in plaintext; passive only.

## Work State
### Completed
- `GET /v1/global/regions` with `Authorization: Bearer x` → 200 + 725B + `ACAO:https://evil.example.com` + `ACAC:true`; no-auth→400 "Authorization header required"; `Auth:x`→400 "scheme 'Bearer' required"; POST→401. STABLE 86h+, unpatched.
- `GET /v1/global/organizations` with NO Authorization → 200 + 11B `{"data":[]}` + CORS; writes 401. STABLE 86h+, read-only.
- Universal CORS credential reflection on all `/v1/**` (OPTIONS 204 + GET 200/401/404/403), non-path-conditional via 22-sibling sweep.
- WorkOS SSO oracle `/v1/identity/workos/auth`: 8 tenants confirmed (spare.com, dart.org, translink.ca, mbta.com, saskatoon.ca, kingcounty.gov, winnipeg.ca +1); winnipeg.ca `conn_01HP76PPV8CMRJH6RYRTWEPSGS`, kingcounty.gov `conn_01JKRZ46KNAQRZN3J3PYTJKWAQ`; connection_id byte-stable per domain; fleet-parity 7 hosts.
- Org-key oracle `/v1/public/organizations/key/{key}` live set CLOSED at {spare (UUID d736519f-f384-4771-a2d2-4f95e884d790), grt (1966c7f8-3e36-4320-b0d7-de0f7d8d4355), dallas (e5f587ba-50e7-4b0c-a2e6-e01f061d048d), winnipeg (6c84b370-5cc2-42c6-8cdd-146c99648535), hsr}; cambus→404; prod-only (uat/us2/jp→404); 22 new candidates all 404.
- Engage write routes `/v1/public/engage/{cases, caseForms}` POST: auth gate ABSENT — empty POST→400 ValidationError (no 401); nil-UUID→404 NotFoundError (handler reached); spare UUID→403 ForbiddenError "External case creation is not enabled for this organization" (feature-flag gate, NOT auth).
- `/v1/public/terms` per-tenant chain: spare→107B literal "asdfd" junk, winnipeg→197B real URL (info.winnipegtransit.com), grt/hsr/dallas→137B generic; prod-only.
- forms.sparelabs.com JS bundle `main.8a2a39cb.js` PATCHED — zero sparelabs/atlassian/ngrok/metabase/vercel refs; 3 Google Maps keys referrer-restricted (leak eliminated; earlier "REACTIVATED" claim was false positive).
