## Objective
- Continuous passive reconnaissance and vulnerability assessment of the Spare bug bounty program (spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com) using GET/HEAD only at ≤1 rps, no account creation, no data modification.
