2. Test other potential WorkOS parameters that might be reflected
3. Check if there are other callback/redirect endpoints that might be vulnerable
4. Consider pivoting to explore the platform.sparelabs.com CSP leak more deeply
5. Verify if the GitHub scan-target issue can be resolved to access sparelabs code

