Excellent — clear 3-way oracle confirmed:

| Response | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `403` + "External case creation is not enabled" | Org exists, feature flag OFF |
| `404` + "Other was not found" | Org does NOT exist |
| `200` | Org exists, feature flag ON → **unauth case submission** |

