## Objective
- Conduct passive-first security assessment of Spare's in-scope assets (spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com) to identify exploitable vulnerabilities.
- Classify, verify, and track all findings through acceptance/rejection lifecycle with deterministic evidence across multi-version envoy LB replicas.

## Important Details
- **Scope**: spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com; ALL other subdomains/out-of-scope
- **Rules**: Passive-first only (GET/HEAD ≤1 rps, no account creation, no data modification); sha256 only for secrets
- **Architecture**: api.sparelabs.com sits behind envoy edge gateway + Google CDN; multi-version envoy LB with fast replicas (4-17ms, new code) and slow replicas (550-1185ms, old code) — this is the mechanism behind 96h+ flapping behavior, NOT patches
- **Fleet parity**: 7 hosts (prod/us/us2/us3/jp/eu/uat) all share the same /v1/global/{organizations,regions} bypass code; prod-only data on public endpoints
- **longcat triage "PATCHED" (2026-08-11)**: Definitively FALSE POSITIVE — only tested no-auth path (400), never tested Bearer-x bypass vector (200+725B)
- **GitHub repo scan**: Persistent runner scan-target misconfig (gladiaio org instead of sparelabs) — 0 files scanned; code-surface delta impossible until fixed

## Work State
### Completed
- **Regions bypass (AUTH)**: Deterministic scheme-only Bearer bypass — `Bearer x` → 200 + 725B region registry (7 regions, 6 OOS api/routing subdomains) on fast replicas; body sha256 `fb9800acb09b65ec92591f4536e3ecfd08b8c3dba0d2ef9af3ed97047795c3fe` byte-stable 86h+; no-auth→400, POST→401 (read-only)
- **Organizations bypass (AUTH)**: Deterministic zero-header read-only bypass — GET no-auth → 200 + 11B `{"data":[]}` + ACAO+ACAC on slow replicas; POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE → 401 InvalidTokenError (write methods properly gated)
- **CORS universal reflection (MISCONFIG)**: ACAO:reflected + ACAC:true + full methods (GET/HEAD/PUT/PATCH/POST/DELETE) + ACAH:Authorization,Content-Type uniform across ALL /v1 paths (22-sibling sweep + 8 undocumented controllers confirmed); 86h+ stable
- **UUID enumeration oracle (IDOR)**: `/v1/public/organizations/{id}` — malformed→400 ValidationError, nil→404 NotFoundError, valid→200 (HUMAN_ONLY); superior to degraded/flapping singular `/v1/public/organization`
- **Org-key 3-way oracle (IDOR)**: `/v1/public/organizations/key/{key}` — live set CLOSED at {spare,grt,dallas,winnipeg,hsr} (5 orgs→200 distinct bodies with UUIDs+feature-flags+logoUrls); 22 new candidates 404; prod-only (uat/us2/jp→404)
- **SSO-config oracle (IDOR)**: `/v1/identity/workos/auth` — 10+ tenants confirmed (spare, dart, translink, mbta, saskatoon, kingcounty, winnipeg, oakville, cota +); state parameter reflected unescaped in authorizeUrl; redirect_uri silently dropped (dead vector); fleet-parity 7 hosts
- **Engage auth gate absent (BUSLOGIC)**: `/v1/public/engage/cases POST` — handler reached without 401 (empty POST→400 ValidationError, nil-UUID→404 NotFoundError, valid orgs→403 ForbiddenError feature-flag gate not auth gate); cross-route org-UUID oracle validated on 4+ orgs
