| 9 | `platform.sparelabs.com/login` CSP infra leak | 70% | Vercel admin apps + Metabase |

## What's left to try

Without **AUTH_HELPED tokens**, we're hitting a wall on escalation paths:
- `/v1/global/regions` POST write escalation → needs valid bearer
- `/v1/global/organizations` POST write escalation → needs valid bearer
- `/v1/public/engage/cases` with valid caseTypeId + org → needs feature flag enabled for target org
- SSO tenant → WorkOS connection exploitation → needs account on target tenant

