- Passive security reconnaissance of Spare Labs' in-scope assets (spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com) to discover and document misconfigurations, auth bypasses, IDORs, and business logic flaws for bug bounty reporting.

