- Passive security reconnaissance of Spare's in-scope assets (spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com) to identify and track vulnerabilities through automated probe cycles.
