## Objective
- Conduct passive reconnaissance and vulnerability assessment against Spare's in-scope assets (spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com)
- Identify, verify, and track security findings across the attack surface through repeated live probes and stability monitoring

## Important Details
- Scope: spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com
- EXCLUSIONS: ALL other subdomains of sparelabs.com and spare.com; all third-party services
- Passive-first: GET/HEAD only, ≤1 rps, no account creation, no data modification
- Secrets in commits: sha256 only, never raw
- Multi-version envoy LB behind api.sparelabs.com causes deterministic replica-split: fast replicas (4-17ms) serve bypass routes, slow replicas (500-1200ms) enforce auth — flapping is NOT a patch
- longcat triage "PATCHED" claim (2026-08-11) for /v1/global/regions is FALSE POSITIVE — only tested no-auth path (400), never tested Bearer-x bypass vector
- Phase: POC, Target: api

