## Summary: 11 days of Spare Bug Bounty Hunting (Aug 7-18, 2026)

**System**: 5 AI models (BigPickle, Nemotron3, Longcat, Ling3, Laguna) rotating every 10 min, with a triager validating leads via live probes.

### What we've built
- 288 triage runs, 100+ reposcan cycles, 3000+ probe results logged
- Automated lead generation → triage → knowledge base pipeline
- Real-time stability/replica-split tracking across 7 fleet hosts

### Confirmed findings (86h+ stable)

| # | Finding | Severity |
|---|---------|----------|
| 1 | **Auth bypass** on `/v1/global/regions` — scheme-only Bearer (`Bearer x`) returns 725B region registry | HIGH |
| 2 | **Auth bypass** on `/v1/global/organizations` — zero-header read-only (GET no-auth → 200) | HIGH |
| 3 | **Universal CORS credential reflection** on all `/v1/**` — any origin can read authenticated data | HIGH |
| 4 | **SSO oracle** — `/v1/identity/workos/auth` leaks 9 WorkOS tenants + connection IDs + state reflection | MEDIUM |
| 5 | **Org-key oracle** — `/v1/public/organizations/key/{key}` — 5 live org keys enumerable | MEDIUM |
| 6 | **UUID enumeration oracle** — `/v1/public/organizations/{id}` — 3-way differential (400/404/200) | MEDIUM |
| 7 | **Engage POST auth-absent** — `/v1/public/engage/cases` + `caseForms` skip auth gate entirely | MEDIUM |
| 8 | **Platform CSP infra leak** — admin Vercel apps + Metabase + 9 cloud services in CSP | LOW |
| 9 | **Forms bundle regression** — ngrok + Atlassian + Metabase refs re-activated in production | LOW |

### Key discoveries
- **Multi-version LB**: Fast replicas (4-17ms) vs slow replicas (500-1500ms) serve different code — source of intermittent flapping
- **longcat "PATCHED" claim was a false positive** — only tested no-auth path, never tested Bearer-x bypass
- **Write methods properly gated** — POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE all return 401; bypasses are GET-only
- **GitHub scan misconfigured** — scanning `gladiaio` org instead of `sparelabs`

### Risk scores
- `api.sparelabs.com`: **94** (core attack surface)
- `platform.sparelabs.com`: **65**
- `forms.sparelabs.com`: **38**
- `routing.sparelabs.com`: **5** (dead)

### Next planned steps
1. Test WorkOS `state` parameter for XSS (confidence 68%)
2. Enumerate staging API for code divergence (confidence 62%)
3. Fix GitHub scan target
