- **api.sparelabs.com/v1/public/organizations/key/{key}**: 3-way org enumeration oracle STABLE — live set CLOSED at {spare,grt,dallas,winnipeg,hsr} (5 orgs); prod-only (uat/us2/jp→404); per-tenant feature-flag differential persists; 22 candidates exhausted
