- **api.sparelabs.com/v1/public/terms**: Per-tenant config chain confirmed — spare→107B "asdfd" junk, winnipeg→197B real URL, grt/hsr/dallas→137B generic; byte-stable; prod-only
- **platform.sparelabs.com/login**: CSP infra leak STABLE — admin-eam-app.vercel.app + admin-fixed-route-app.vercel.app (prod+staging, loadable 200) + Metabase (prod+staging 200) + 9 cloud services; strict HTML CSP + x-frame SAMEORIGIN only mitigates HTML-level
- **forms.sparelabs.com JS bundle**: main.63fe135c.js REGRESSION — ngrok (api-spare.ngrok.io), Atlassian (FIN-1093), Metabase client class reactivated; CA forms route to api.us.sparelabs.com (CA→US data routing)
