- Passive security assessment of Spare Labs bug bounty program (spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com)
- Identify and validate security misconfigurations, auth bypasses, IDORs, and business logic flaws via passive-only probes (GET/HEAD, ≤1 rps, no account creation, no data modification)

## Important Details
- Scope IN: spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com
- Scope OUT: ALL other subdomains of sparelabs.com and spare.com; third-party services (metabase.*.sparelabs.com, admin-*.vercel.app, api-staking/ngrok/ngrok.io)
- Passive-first constraint: GET/HEAD only, ≤1 rps, no account creation, no data modification
- Secrets in commits: sha256 only, never raw
- Phase: POC; Target: api
- Environment: `{"phase": "POC", "target": "api"}`

## Work State

### Completed
