  - `/v1/global/organizations`: complete zero-header read-only bypass — GET NO-Auth → 200 + 11B `{"data":[]}` + ACAO+ACAC; slow replicas 8/8 bypass; POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE → 401 InvalidTokenError (read-only); OPTIONS 204 advertises write methods (handler-level write gating)
