1. **Forms bundle regression** - `main.60865478.js` (7.1MB) contains `https://api-spare.ngrok.io` hardcoded + `localhost:3000`, `localhost:3035`. Previous "patched" bundle `main.8a2a39cb.js` is now a stub HTML that loads the new bundle.
