Hit staging rate limit after 7 requests. All returned `ForbiddenError: External case creation is not enabled` — feature-gated, not auth-gated. Staging has tighter rate limits than prod.

Key staging findings so far:
- **Regions**: 2 regions (CA, US) with flat array + `apiUrl`+`routingHost` fields (infra leak)
- **Org-key**: Only `spare` exists, different UUID (`d736519f...`)
- **Terms**: Real URLs for ALL mobileAppId (no per-tenant filtering)
- **WorkOS**: Only `spare.com` tenant, different client_id/connection
- **Engage**: Feature-gated ("External case creation not enabled"), not auth-gated

Let me check staging platform and forms for additional divergence.
