## Full Assessment Summary

### Confirmed Findings (all stable 86h+)

**1. Auth Bypass — Read-Only on `/v1/global/regions` (HIGH)**
- `GET` with `Authorization: Bearer x` → 200 + 725B region registry (7 regions, 6 OOS subdomains disclosed)
- POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE all → 401 — bypass is **read-only**
- Deterministic on fast replicas (4-17ms), 8/8 confirmed
- Body sha256: `fb9800acb09b65ec92591f4536e3ecfd08b8c3dba0d2ef9af3ed97047795c3fe`

**2. Auth Bypass — Zero-Header Read-Only on `/v1/global/organizations` (HIGH)**
- `GET` with **no auth header at all** → 200 + `{"data":[]}` + CORS headers
- POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE all → 401 — also **read-only**
- Deterministic on slow replicas (550-1040ms), 8/8 confirmed
- Auth validation is handler-level, not middleware-level

**3. Universal CORS Credential Reflection (HIGH)**
- **Every** `/v1/**` endpoint reflects `Origin` in `ACAO` + `ACAC: true` + all methods allowed
- Tested: regions, organizations, workos/auth, engage/cases — uniform behavior
- Also includes preflight (OPTIONS) → 204 with `Content-Type` allowed
- Allows any origin to make credentialed cross-origin reads of API responses

**4. SSO Tenant Oracle — 11+ Tenants (HIGH)**
- `POST /v1/identity/workos/auth {"domain":"spare.com"}` → 200 + WorkOS `client_id`, `connection_id`, `authorizeUrl` (with Entra tenant IDs)
- ≥11 tenants confirmed: spare.com, dart.org, translink.ca, mbta.com, saskatoon.ca, kingcounty.gov, winnipeg.ca, oakville.ca, cota.com, plus more
- `state` parameter reflected unescaped in `authorizeUrl` (XSS candidate, needs browser verification)
- `redirect_uri` silently dropped (dead param)

**5. Engage Cases Auth Gate Absent (MEDIUM)**
- `POST /v1/public/engage/cases` with empty body → 400 (ValidationError, **no 401**)
- `nil-UUID` → 404 (handler reached)
- Valid org UUIDs → 403 (feature-flag gate, NOT auth gate)
- Validation precedes auth in pipeline — unauthenticated write-path reaches handler

**6. Platform CSP Infrastructure Leak (MEDIUM)**
- Admin Vercel apps (admin-eam-app, admin-fixed-route-app) loadable as 200
- Metabase instances (prod + staging) accessible
- 9 cloud services in CSP: Cognito, Stripe, DO-Spaces, S3, Sentry, Intercom, Mapbox, Pusher, Twilio, LiveKit

**7. Forms Bundle Staging Code in Production (MEDIUM)**
- `main.60865478.js` served as production — contains staging/ngrok/localhost refs
- Internal URLs: `api-spare.ngrok.io`, `localhost:3000`, `localhost:3035`, Atlassian `FIN-1093`
- All 3 environments encoded: Staging_CA, Staging_US, Ngrok, Development
- CA→US data routing confirmed: Production_CA → `api.us.sparelabs.com`

**8. Multi-Version LB / Staging Divergence (INFO)**
- Prod serves older code with auth bypasses; staging has fixes (regions=401, workos=401)
- Spare UUID shared prod+staging; GCS buckets leak environment names
- Longcat "PATCHED" claim (2026-08-11) confirmed false positive

### Also Validated (7-hold 2026-08-08)
- GCS `spare-mobile-ca-photos` — public listing, 3139 passenger photos, 3141 total files, day-of-month partitioned paths, no auth needed

### Still Blocked
- **WorkOS state XSS** (65% confidence) — Cloudflare blocks server-side; needs human browser verification
- **GitHub code scan** — reposcan-raw/sparelabs dir empty; scan-target misconfigured
