## Objective
- Conduct a passive-first security assessment of Spare's in-scope assets (spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com)
- Identify and track confirmed vulnerabilities, monitor stability of findings over time, and propose next actions for escalation

## Important Details
- **Scope**: spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com. ALL other subdomains of sparelabs.com and spare.com are OUT OF SCOPE
- **Rules**: Passive-first only (GET/HEAD, ≤1 rps, no account creation, no data modification). Secrets in commits: sha256 only, never raw
- **Phase**: POC (Proof of Concept), target: api
- **Multi-version LB**: api.sparelabs.com runs behind envoy with multi-version LB — fast replicas (2-5ms) vs slow replicas (400-1500ms) serve different code versions; prod serves OLDER code with auth bypasses, staging has fixes
- **Fleet topology**: 7 hosts (prod/us/us2/us3/jp/eu/uat) all return bypasses fleet-wide; data oracles (UUID/org-key/SSO) are CA-specific only
- **longcat triage "PATCHED" claim (2026-08-11) is FALSE POSITIVE**: longcat only tested no-auth path (400), never tested the actual Bearer-x bypass vector which returns 200+725B
- **Body sha256**: Regions body sha256 `fb9800acb09b65ec92591f4536e3ecfd08b8c3dba0d2ef9af3ed97047795c3fe` byte-stable 86h+
- **GitHub repo scan broken**: scan-target misconfigured (gladiaio org instead of sparelabs), reposcan-raw/sparelabs dir empty — no code-surface delta until fixed

## Work State
### Completed
- **CONFIRMED AUTH @ /v1/global/regions**: Scheme-only Bearer bypass — `Bearer x` → 200 + 725B region registry (7 regions, 6 OOS api/routing subdomains) + ACAO+ACAC; no-auth→400; POST→401; deterministic on fast replicas (8/8); body sha256 verified 86h+
- **CONFIRMED AUTH @ /v1/global/organizations**: Zero-header read-only bypass — GET no-auth → 200 + 11B `{"data":[]}` + ACAO+ACAC; POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE → 401 InvalidTokenError; deterministic on slow replicas (8/8); auth asymmetry confirmed
- **CONFIRMED BUSLOGIC @ /v1/public/engage/cases POST**: Auth gate ABSENT — validation precedes auth in pipeline; empty POST→400 (no 401), nil-UUID→404 (handler reached), valid org UUIDs→403 ForbiddenError (feature-flag gate NOT auth gate); CORS reflected; cross-route org-UUID oracle validated on 4 orgs (spare/grt/dallas/winnipeg)
- **CONFIRMED BUSLOGIC @ /v1/public/engage/caseForms POST**: Same pattern — auth gate absent, validation precedes auth, handler reached without 401
- **CONFIRMED IDOR @ /v1/identity/workos/auth**: SSO-config oracle ≥11 tenants confirmed; state param reflected unescaped in authorizeUrl; redirect_uri silently dropped (dead); fleet-parity across 7 hosts
- **CONFIRMED IDOR @ /v1/public/organizations/{id}**: 3-way UUID enumeration oracle (malformed→400, nil→404, valid→200); superior to degraded singular
- **CONFIRMED IDOR @ /v1/public/organizations/key/{key}**: 3-way org enumeration; live set closed at 5 orgs {spare,grt,dallas,winnipeg,hsr}; 22 candidates exhausted; prod-only data; per-tenant feature-flag differential persists
- **CONFIRMED MISCONFIG @ /v1/**: Universal CORS credential reflection (ACAO:reflected + ACAC:true + all methods + Authorization header) uniform across all /v1 paths; non-path-conditional via 22-sibling sweep; 86h+ stable
- **CONFIRMED MISCONFIG @ /v1/public/terms**: Per-tenant config chain (spare→107B "asdfd" junk, winnipeg→197B real URL, grt/hsr/dallas→137B generic); byte-stable; prod-only
- **CONFIRMED MISCONFIG @ platform.sparelabs.com/login**: CSP infra leak — admin-eam-app + admin-fixed-route-app (prod+staging, loadable 200) + Metabase (prod+staging, 200) + 9 cloud services in CSP; strict HTML CSP + x-frame SAMEORIGIN only mitigates HTML-level
- **CONFIRMED bundle regression**: forms.sparelabs.com now serves main.60865478.js (staging bundle) with ngrok/Atlassian/localhost refs; CA→US data routing confirmed (Production_CA→api.us.sparelabs.com)
- **CONFIRMED staging divergence**: api.staging.sparelabs.com has different code version — regions=400 (no bypass), workos=401 (no oracle), terms returns real URLs for all mobileAppId
- **REJECTED**: routing.sparelabs.com (STABLE dead since 2026-08-07), forms.sparelabs.com HTML CSP (SPA catch-all), platform/forms admin path sweeps (no real API), controller-wide bypass hypothesis (22 siblings all 401), write-escalation (POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE all 401), longcat "PATCHED" claim (false positive), redirect_uri injection (silently dropped)

