### Blocked
- **GitHub code scan**: reposcan-raw/sparelabs dir empty; scan-target misconfigured (gladiaio org). Cannot scan Spare's actual source code.
- **WorkOS XSS verification**: Cloudflare blocks server IP from accessing WorkOS authorize page (HTTP 403). Requires AUTH_HELPED browser-based verification.
- **Engage POST write exploitation**: Handler-level feature-flag gate (403) blocks case creation for all tested orgs; AUTH_HELPED needed to discover if any org has the feature flag enabled.
- **Engage GET schema disclosure**: Flapping between OpenAPI validation (400 required fields) and router-level "not found" (400) across envoy replicas; unreliable for passive exploitation.

