- **Scope OUT**: ALL other subdomains of sparelabs.com and spare.com; third-party services; secrets sha256 only
- **Passive-first**: GET/HEAD only, ≤1 rps, no auth bypass exploitation, no data modification
- **Fleet topology**: 7 hosts (prod, us, us2, us3, jp, eu, uat) all share same bypass code; data oracles (org-key, UUID, SSO) are CA/prod-specific
- **Multi-version envoy LB**: fast replicas (4-17ms) vs slow replicas (500-1200ms); determines which code version serves requests; source of flapping behavior
- **Longcat triage false positive**: "PATCHED" claim for /v1/global/regions (2026-08-11) only tested no-auth path (400), never tested Bearer-x bypass vector
- **Staging has fixes prod lacks**: api.staging.sparelabs.com returns 401 on regions (no bypass), 401 on workos/auth (no oracle), terms returns real URLs for all mobileAppId
- **known org UUIDs**: spare=d736519f-f384-4771-a2d2-4f95e884d790, grt=1966c7f8-3e36-4320-b0d7-de0f7d8d4355, dallas=e5f587ba-50e7-4b0c-a2e6-e01f061d048d, winnipeg=6c84b370-5cc2-42c6-8cdd-146c99648535, hsr=83303a6b-fb96-4ff3-8f58-d6069a043fbb
- **GitHub repo scan pipeline broken**: scan-target misconfigured (gladiaio org instead of sparelabs), reposcan-raw/sparelabs dir empty since 2026-08-09
- **Per-tenant feature flags**: spare=[5: riderLoginless, multimodal, riderPhonePin, +2], winnipeg=[4], grt=[2: multimodal], hsr=[2], dallas=[0]

