## Objective
- Conduct continuous passive security reconnaissance and vulnerability assessment of Spare's in-scope assets (spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com)
- Track, verify, and stabilize findings across sessions; identify new attack surface; report actionable bugs

## Important Details
- **Scope**: spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com — ALL OTHER subdomains excluded
- **Rules**: Passive-first (GET/HEAD only, ≤1 rps), no account creation, no data modification, sha256 only for secrets
- **Phase**: POC — targeting api surface
- **Multi-version envoy LB**: Production runs multiple code versions behind envoy; fast replicas (2-5ms) vs slow replicas (500-1100ms) serve different code, causing intermittent bypass/flapping behavior
- **7-host fleet**: prod/us/us2/us3/jp/eu/uat all share env bypass code but data oracles are CA-specific (prod-only data residency)
- **longcat "PATCHED" false positive** (2026-08-11): only tested no-auth path (400), never tested Bearer-x vector; bypass confirmed NOT patched across all subsequent probes
- **Staging differs from prod**: api.staging.sparelabs.com has regions auth enforced (401), workos auth enforced (401), different terms error path — staging is newer code

## Work State
### Completed
- **Auth bypass family** (86h+ stable, 13+ days unpatched):
  - `/v1/global/regions`: scheme-only Bearer bypass — `Bearer x` → 200+725B region registry (7 regions, 6 OOS subdomains) + ACAO+ACAC; deterministic on 8/8 fast replicas; body sha256 `fb9800acb09b65ec92591f4536e3ecfd08b8c3dba0d2ef9af3ed97047795c3fe` byte-stable
  - `/v1/global/organizations`: zero-header read-only bypass — GET no-auth → 200+11B `{"data":[]}` + ACAO+ACAC; deterministic on 8/8 slow replicas; POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE → 401 InvalidTokenError (read-only, auth asymmetry)
  - Route-specific only: 22 sibling routes + 8 undocumented controllers all 401
  - Write escalation REJECTED: POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE → 401 on both bypass routes
- **CORS universal credential reflection** (86h+ stable): ACAO:reflected + ACAC:true + all methods + ACAH:Authorization,Content-Type on all /v1 paths (OPTIONS 204 + GET 200/401/403/404); non-path-conditional via 22-sibling sweep
- **SSO-config oracle** `/v1/identity/workos/auth`: ≥11 tenants confirmed (spare.com, dart.org, translink.ca, mbta.com, saskatoon.ca, kingcounty.gov, winnipeg.ca, oakville.ca, cota.com, +); POST domain param discriminates 200 vs 404; state reflected unescaped in authorizeUrl; redirect_uri silently dropped (param injection dead); fleet-parity 7 hosts; staging has auth enforced (401)
- **Org-key oracle** `/v1/public/organizations/key/{key}`: live set CLOSED at 5 orgs {spare,grt,dallas,winnipeg,hsr}; 3-way discrimination (200/404); prod-only data (uat/us2/jp→404); feature-flag differential stable
- **Cross-route org-UUID oracle** `/v1/public/engage/cases POST`: auth gate ABSENT — validation precedes auth; valid org UUIDs → 403 ForbiddenError (feature-flag gate); nil→404; CORS reflected; validated on 5 orgs
- **Engage caseForms POST**: auth gate ABSENT, formKey-existence oracle hypothesis RETAINED at 85 (404 "Form was not found" vs 200); formId bridge requires AUTH_HELPED token
- **UUID enumeration oracle** `/v1/public/organizations/{id}`: 3-way stable (malformed→400, nil→404, valid→200 HUMAN_ONLY); superior to flapping singular `/v1/public/organization`
- **Platform CSP leak**: admin-eam-app.vercel.app + admin-fixed-route-app.vercel.app (prod+staging, loadable 200) + Metabase (prod+staging 200) + 9 cloud services in CSP directives
- **Per-tenant terms disclosure**: spare→107B junk "asdfd", winnipeg→197B real URL, grt/hsr/dallas→137B generic; byte-stable; prod-only
- **Forms bundle regression**: main.60865478.js contains ngrok/Atlassian/localhost/staging refs; CA→US data routing (api.us.sparelabs.com)
- **routing.sparelabs.com**: STABLE dead (envoy 404/0B on ALL paths since 2026-08-07)
- **GitHub repo scan**: scan-target misconfigured (gladiaio org instead of sparelabs), 0 files scanned — no code-surface delta

### Active
- **formKey-existence oracle** on `/v1/public/engage/caseForms POST`: hypothesis retained at 85; need valid formKeys from bundle/API config to demonstrate 200 vs 404 differential; NEXT probe queued
- **Staging-to-prod divergence tracking**: api.staging.sparelabs.com has auth fixes prod lacks; different code version confirmed
- **Engage GET flapping**: multi-version LB serves OpenAPI validation (400) on some replicas and router "not found" (400) on others — unreliable, UNCONFIRMED

### Blocked
- **AUTH_HELPED tokens needed** for: engage caseForms formId bridge, engage POST full payload chain, WorkOS callback analysis, potential IDOR on authenticated routes
- **GitHub code scan**: clone target misconfigured (gladiaio not sparelabs), cannot perform code-surface analysis
- **Engage GET schema disclosure**: flapping between 400 validation/not-found across replicas — cannot reliably reproduce 200+schema bodies
- **redirect_uri XSS chain**: Cloudflare blocks direct WorkOS access from server IP (403); state reflection only URL-encoded passthrough; full XSS chain requires browser verification

